eam":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RPD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8c1d7285-2856-4c95-88aa-bbc568f29407","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"しかしリストアの UI が流石に不便すぎてなぁ。正直あれだとゴミ箱に捨てられても復元が実質不可能だと思う","ts":"1630313572.025500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iUIB5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5ab0d573-c826-4ab6-b843-f545c5ba2998","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ゴミ箱が存在するデスクトップ環境が自宅にないもんでな","ts":"1630313567.025400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uduR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e7a74669-18d9-4110-9ce3-34a8ec91e086","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"あとは個人的には恩恵ないけど デスクトップ(XDG だったかな)のゴミ箱と互換があるらしい","ts":"1630313539.024600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gwAol"}]},{"client_msg_id":"781614a7-fcd4-4455-9779-762e1453c844","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"gomi は trash-cli がそうなってるから gomi もそうだと嬉しいって私がお願いしてそうしてもらった…","ts":"1630313453.023900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"muH8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8f320096-5bb9-4506-9cfa-d6cb312bdc34","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"互換と言っても、-r や -f は何もしない","ts":"1630313431.023400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UGBFD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2903672c-158b-4c76-bbbe-6f160f5af3f1","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"gomi もできますね","ts":"1630313417.023100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aXf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"40cd446a-9192-430a-a3f6-9d880e9daaa5","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"trash-cli はコマンドラインオプションが rm 互換になっていて置き換えられるってコンセプトもポイント高いんだよね","ts":"1630313397.022600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tQBZ3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"81cafcf3-e1eb-4eb8-96d5-1eaad3b6e823","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/andreafrancia/trash-cli/blob/master/trashcli/fstab.py\u003e\nmount 状態見てるの、これか","ts":"1630312816.021900","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/andreafrancia/trash-cli/blob/master/trashcli/fstab.py | fstab.py\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/andreafrancia/trash-cli/blob/master/trashcli/fstab.py | fstab.py\u003e","text":"```\nimport os\n\n\ndef volume_of(path) :\n    return volumes.volume_of(path)\n\n\ndef create_fake_volume_of(volumes):\n    return Volumes(FakeIsMount(volumes), os.path.normpath)\n\n\nclass RealIsMount:\n    def is_mount(self, path):\n        return os.path.ismount(path)\n\n\nclass FakeIsMount:\n    def __init__(self, mount_points):\n        self.fakes = set(['/'])\n        for mp in mount_points:\n            self.fakes.add(mp)\n\n    def is_mount(self, path):\n        if path == '/':\n            return True\n        path = os.path.normpath(path)\n        if path in self.fakes:\n            return True\n        return False\n\n\nclass Volumes:\n    def __init__(self, ismount, abspath):\n        self.ismount = ismount\n        self.abspath = abspath\n\n    def volume_of(self, path):\n        path = self.abspath(path)\n        while path != os.path.dirname(path):\n            if self.ismount.is_mount(path):\n                break\n            path = os.path.dirname(path)\n        return path\n\n\nvolumes = Volumes(RealIsMount(), os.path.abspath)\n\n\nclass VolumesListing:\n    def __init__(self, os_mount_points):\n        self.os_mount_points = os_mount_points\n\n    def list_volumes(self, environ):\n        if 'TRASH_VOLUMES' in environ and environ['TRASH_VOLUMES']:\n            return [vol\n                    for vol in environ['TRASH_VOLUMES'].split(':')\n                    if vol != '']\n        return self.os_mount_points()\n\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/andreafrancia/trash-cli|andreafrancia/trash-cli\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NXf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"99c4ddb1-467d-442b-ba94-e444e4eed374","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ホームディレクトリに移動するタイプだと自分の場合ホームがRAM上にあるので爆発する","ts":"1630312618.020500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NDl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0159796a-ceb1-4f8c-a630-f1b2a333a238","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"大量のファイルが存在するディレクトリを指定すると固まります","ts":"1630312600.020000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"yabai","count":2,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G0c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"17fd561c-cf4e-4b28-bf59-5c605fced65a","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"マウントポイント見てくれないと何が起こるんでしょう？\n(マウントポイントの知識がゼロ。。)","ts":"1630312579.019600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0ESX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"86e97a63-b3a1-4eb3-aae2-5329f521104b","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"gomi確かマウントポイント見てくれないんすよねー","ts":"1630312505.019300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"contribute-chance","count":1,"users":["U06ECBRTJ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p6Gb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b8d2c521-93c8-4efa-80d7-2166f22c695d","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"rmはほとんど-rfと一緒に使うので、 `rm -rf` で一つのコマンドみたいに思ってるんですよね。\nたしかにtrashに移動するコマンド使うようにした方が安全ですよね。。","ts":"1630312473.018800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5MQ"}]},{"clie